  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 24fd00da0cc416b4c9162d83f11598ca, type: 3}
  description: "Cerberus is a medium-sized demonic beast, roughly the size of a large
    wolf or small bear, with a thick, whipping tail and three heads. It moves at
    a steady pace, closing in like a hunter that never tires rather than a sprinter.
    It does not speak - its sounds are purely animalistic: deep snarls, guttural
    growls, and chorus-like barking that feels more like a warning from the underworld
    than a natural animal\u2019s voice."
